# The Opossum: Thanksgiving's Safety, as the Owl is Halloween's. Hanging
# back on its hind legs, ready to play dead: a pale pointed face with dark
# eyes and a pink nose, small dark ears, and a long bare pink tail.
size 7 9 6
voxel 0.11
colors
  P purple
  d purpleDark
  l purpleLight
  k ink
  n candyPink
# Feet, body and belly.
box 2 0 1 2 0 2 d
box 4 0 1 4 0 2 d
box 1 1 1 5 5 4 P
box 2 1 1 4 4 1 l
# Arms.
box 0 4 1 0 4 2 P
box 6 4 1 6 4 2 P
# Pale face, snout, nose, eyes, ears.
box 2 6 1 4 8 3 l
box 3 6 0 3 6 0 l
box 3 6 0 3 6 0 n
box 2 7 1 2 7 1 k
box 4 7 1 4 7 1 k
box 1 8 2 1 8 3 d
box 5 8 2 5 8 3 d
# The tail.
box 3 1 5 3 1 5 n
box 3 2 5 3 3 5 n
